<title>USA: Lifecell names Donald Payne as CFO.</title>
<headline>Lifecell names Donald Payne as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lifecell Corp said Thursday it had named J. Donald Payne as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Payne was most recently vice president of finance, chief financial officer and director of Aprogenex Inc, Lifecell said.</p>
